<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss April trade figures due on May 27.</title>
<headline>Swiss April trade figures due on May 27.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss provisional import and export figures for April will be released on May 27 at 8:15 a.m. (0615 GMT), the Federal Customs Office said.</p>
<p>Revised March figures showed a surplus of 0.2 million Swiss Francs on imports of 8,331.2 million and exports of 8,331.4 million.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
